module Collections

### Suflae SF-realm Collections sorted dict — wrapper over RF::Collections.SortedDict[K, V].
### Entity + default constructor hand-written; every other method auto-forwarded (SuflaeForwarders).
entity SortedDict[K, V]
  secret inner: RF::Collections.SortedDict[K, V]

routine SortedDict[K, V]() -> SortedDict[K, V]
  return SortedDict[K, V](inner: RF::Collections.SortedDict[K, V]())
